      "sourceTextSha256": "be790187a44ef0ccc0b3858aeba19b5312faed11b45b991925cb8285ab306ea6",
      "text": "Day 4 · After breakfast, transfer to the airport for your flight to Manaus, where you are welcomed and transferred to the pier for a speedboat ride (about 1 hour 20 minutes) to the Evolução Ecolodge, with a welcome drink and check-in. Lunch at 12:00; at 15:00, the first excursions by canoe, visiting the igapó (flooded forest) and fishing for piranhas. Dinner at 19:00 and a free evening.",
